sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Utilisateur
    participant Agent as Agent autonome
    participant State as AgentState
    participant Registry as ToolRegistry
    participant Human as Humain

    User->>Agent: Objectif métier
    Agent->>State: Initialise l'état
    Agent->>State: Crée le plan
    loop Jusqu'à arrêt
        Agent->>State: Sélectionne prochaine tâche
        Agent->>Agent: Vérifie budget, max_steps, approval
        alt Action sensible sans approbation
            Agent->>Human: Demande validation
            Agent->>State: status = needs_input
        else Action autorisée
            Agent->>Registry: execute(tool, args)
            Registry-->>Agent: observation
            Agent->>State: Ajoute observation + trace
        end
    end
    Agent->>State: Compose final_answer
    Agent-->>User: Réponse finale
